WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 5.1 · Internal Systems & Operations
What a system is: your organisational operating map

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
A system is a repeatable way of doing necessary work, with one owner.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. List each system and the person who owns it.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Map what passes from one system to another.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Mark where hand-offs fail today.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Imara Girls in Science (Registered nonprofit · delivering, Kenya)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Attendance moves from club tablets to funder reports. It fails where two schools have no signal.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create your operating map: systems, owners and hand-offs.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
